Today is Saturday morning.
I am standing outside the community café in my area.
A very nice aroma of fresh coffee is coming from here.
I take a deep breath.
I have come here to help as a volunteer.
I want to meet new local people.
Today is my first day of work.
I am going to learn to make coffee at the counter.
There is a large crowd of people inside the café.
Everyone is chatting happily.
I open the door of the café and go inside.
There is a little nervousness in my mind.
I have never worked in a café before.
But I like to learn new tasks.
I am going to stand behind the counter for the first time.
I am very excited for my work.
